OL,3,GNEWSATrain journey to mark birth of UK
OL,4,Ahigh speed rail
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparations are under way for a
OL,7,Fcommemorative train journey to mark the
OL,8,Fbirth of the UK's first high-speed rail
OL,9,Fservice.
OL,11,FThe arrival of the Intercity 125 HST on
OL,12,Fthe route between London and Bristol in
OL,13,F1976 meant passengers could now travel
OL,14,Fon trains at up to 125mph - 25% faster
OL,15,Fthan any other service in Britain.
OL,17,FOriginally seen as a stopgap, the
OL,18,Fdiesel powered trains allowed the
OL,19,Fthen-national operator, British Rail,
OL,20,Fto fight back against the motor car,
OL,21,Fespecially for people making journeys
OL,22,Ffor business.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
