OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrain journey to mark birth of UK
OL,4,Ahigh speed rail
OL,5,
OL,6,FGary Heelas, of the 125 group, which
OL,7,Fwill be running the preserved train
OL,8,Ffrom Paddington through Bristol and on
OL,9,Fto South Wales, said: "We're basically
OL,10,Fretracing the steps on that very first
OL,11,Fday."
